{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34161","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 三宿神景宫 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 三宿神景宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵踪未徧寻，不觉谿色瞑。\n回头问栖所，稍下杉萝迳。\n岩居更幽绝，涧户相隐映。\n过此即神宫，虚堂惬云性。\n四轩尽疎达，一榻何清零。\n髣髴闻玉笙，鼓铿动凉磬。\n风凝古松粒，露压修荷柄。\n万籁既无声，澄明但心听。\n希微辨真语，若授虚皇命。\n尺宅按来平，华池漱余净。\n频窥宿羽丽，三吸晨霞盛。\n岂独冷衣襟，便堪遗造请。\n徒深物外趣，未脱尘中病。\n举首谢灵峰，徜徉事归榜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}